"Language: fr\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);\n"

#: gaia_globe/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "GLOBE"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/16/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Well hello adventurer! That was some quest we went on!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/19/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Well hello adventurer! That was some quest we went on, though we missed you at the end."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A red-haired traveler lifts her goggles to peek at you, revealing freckled cheeks and stunning blue eyes. There's a friendly air about her that makes you want to hear her stories."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/30
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Now... b'y m'love you looks some lost. Where y'longs to?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"Buy your love\"?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh! Sorry. Sometimes my accent comes out when I get too excited."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Haha! Sorry, sorry. Sometimes my accent comes out when I'm excited."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I was made in Newfoundland, ya see. This little rock riiiight..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She spins around and points to one of the patches on her jacket sleeves."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/22
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...here!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/33
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Friendliest folk you'll ever meet, but the dialect can be a little much for some. I'll try to speak plain for ya. Name's Gaia, by the way."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/44
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "So! Where are you from?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh. Well... we're in my house, so..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nowhere."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Newfoundland."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm from"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ah... Here, then. Right. Makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sure b'y, me too. Got nowhere to be from and nothin' to be doin'."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I won't pry if ya don't like it."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Really? I've never seen you 'round St. John's have I?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ah that makes sense with the accent I'm hearin' on ya."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "It's a right shame, though..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "See, I got all these countries and rivers and seas on my jacket. It's a collection I been workin' on. And I know the names, but I don't really know the PLACES, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I mean, heck, I got 'em all memorized even. United States, Canada, Mexico, Panama, the works. But without a story behind it, they all feel so far away."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You think they'd be in arm's reach, considering they're on my sleeves. But it's a brain problem. I just can't pin anything down without <i>context</i>."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Without stories, maps're just paper. Dots and lines."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/51
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "The reason I ask where you're from is so I can shape the places in my mind with some kinda meaning. 'Cause right now it feels a bit like I'm just wearing a big vest of unchecked boxes!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/59
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh, jeez, here I go, talkin' your ear off. Sorry about that."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/67
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "It's just..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/75
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I'm having trouble putting myself out there. And I'm <i>so</i> interested in being \"out there\"."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/83/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about the Quest? Was that enough?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/84/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why can't you just warp around like everyone else seems to be able to do?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sure! But how many quests are there like that 'un?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-6/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like you're about to give me one of your own..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-6/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I see what you mean."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sharp!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I've tried!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I want to talk to the others, but I think I must be too forward or something! I skip on up to them and ask them about themselves, and they just run away!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-2/8/s/0 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-4/19/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That can't be. You seem so nice!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh, y'know."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "It's not about just being nice..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I come up to the others so I can ask about 'em. Get to know 'em, who they are."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "But before I can get to the point I always go spoutin' off about somethin' or other - like telling 'em factoids I've heard about what I imagine their home to be."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "And 9 times out of 10 I'm some level of wrong."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...and the other time I'm right but it's in an insulting way."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "One thing leads to another and they give me this look. Then soon enough they find an excuse to leave. I'm just. Bad at it, I guess!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/40/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sometimes I feel like no matter how hard I push myself, I'm just going in circles. Y'know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/40/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I'm working on getting better with people too."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/40/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh huh..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/40/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know what you mean."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/40/c-10/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "It's hard, isn't it?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/40/c-10/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I can see why you'd need to practice for dating. It's just too easy to mess up."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/40/c-10/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You say one wrong thing and POOF! They're gone! It's so frustrating!!!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/40/c-10/31
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Er... sorry. I think I might be <i>Mercator</i> Projecting on your situation a little bit."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-3/40/c-12/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "There I go, speakin' in circles again..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh! WHOA!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I just had the best idea!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You're running to the four winds meetin' with people and speakin' with the others, yeah? I'm sure some of those folks come from other places, right?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Travelers, y'know's what I'm sayin'?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-5/32
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Why don't you ask 'em what they're about? Get to know 'em a little better, figures how they ticks, then come back 'n we'll have a yarn! Sound good?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-5/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, I didn't catch that exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-5/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I get what you're puttin' down."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-5/c-13/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Speak plain, Gaia, speak plain..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-5/c-13/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Okay. So."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You're speaking with objects all over the house. You know how some of us have little labels that say things like \"Made in China\" or \"Hecho en Argentina\" on the bottom?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Well, that means those objects are <b>Travelers!</b> They come from away!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "They're from somewhere else! Somewhere on my jacket!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "THOSE are the objects I need to talk to! Those are the ones who can fill out my checklist!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-6/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Travelers..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-6/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love filling out checklists."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-6/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel an adventure coming on."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "This map is uncharted. But if you can bring me back <b>stories from those travelers</b>, then I'd be able to write little notes down here and there, and pretty soon I'll be a bonafide travel guide!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "It's everything I've ever wanted. And you'll get a chance to practice talking more!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Are you shy? I can help! People tell me that I never shut up. I can help <i>you</i> learn to never shut up! Doesn't that sound great?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That'd be perfect!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you said that everyone runs away from you..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don't you just look stuff up online?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/c-18/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Right?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/c-19/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Yeah. Well, then I'll stand on the other side of them so they run towards you!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/c-19/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "C'mon! Please, pretty please?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/c-20/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "No way! That stuff is useless!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/c-20/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I want first-hand stories! Something with a personal touch!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/c-20/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Second-hand sources are boring. Heck, <i>I'm</i> a second-hand source and I don't know anything. I mean, what the heck is \"Arr-Kansas?\" Is that like a second Kansas just for pirates? Who knows!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-7/c-20/31
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "This is exactly why I need your help."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I'm sure it'll work out. You scratch my cartouche, I'll scratch yours."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Whaddaya say, partner? Exploration buddies?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, why not?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I think I've already met some travelers!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Really?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Aw, I appreciate it! Really saves me a lot of hemmin' and hawin'!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You go out and find some objects from foreign lands. Oh, and let me know if you need any help!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/31
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "It's hard to explain, but I've got a pretty good sense of these things. I can't give you an exact name or anything for who to talk to, but I <i>can</i> get you close!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "It's kind of like a geocache. I can give you an idea of their general location, but if you want to find those travelers you'll need to hunt 'em down yourself."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/47
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I've learned firsthand that others don't take it too well if you run up to them and scream \"WHERE ARE YOU FROM?!\""
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like you did with me?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Yeah! Like that! That was a disaster!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Point is, you can't just ask objects about their origins out of the gate. You gotta <b>awaken</b> 'em first."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/26
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Don't worry too much about the details. Once you're close with someone, you'll learn more about them automatically."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/34
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "So! What do you say? Do you want some hints on where to find travelers?! Or do you feel like searching on yer own?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hint, please!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm feeling lucky!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Alright! Hint! Hint, hint, hint!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/c-0/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Let's spin me round and see which object I get a sense for..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/c-1/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Nice!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/c-1/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "(Not to be confused with <i>Nice...</i>)"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/c-1/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Alright, fellow explorer! G'wan then! Don't be too long!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/c-1/31
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Seriously, though. Don't be too long. I get so antsy just sitting here spinning in place."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/c-1/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Be sure to <b>check in with me every once in awhile</b> even if you haven't found any Travelers yet! I can wait a bit, but..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/c-1/47
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Mmmmmmmmm, I'm honestly pretty impatient! Especially when I'm EXCITED!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-21/58/c-0/42/c-1/58
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-22/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "O-Oh. Uh... okay then! No problem. Just remember that I'll be here if you change your mind. Okay?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_firstencounter/0/g-8/c-22/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I'll always be... right here."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Hello again, m'love! Got any traveler stories for me?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh. You're back! Don't suppose you had second thoughts about helping me chat up some world-travelers?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, actually. I spoke with someone."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m not really sure where to find \"world-travelers\". Any leads?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing yet, but I'll keep looking."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is dumb."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I've got a general sense of where they are! Let's spin me around and see who I can find!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-1/15 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-22/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "<w>Wheeeee!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-2/7 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ok! Well keep at it, friend! Thanks for checking in. I’ll be waiting!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...what?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "None of these objects are really \"Travelers\"."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "What d'ya mean?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All objects are from so many different places."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "So?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So it's silly to think that they would have something to teach you about their 'homeland'. It's reductive."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just because they look a certain way or have an accent doesn't mean they are encyclopedias on one country."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I'm sorry you feel that way... but it gives me joy."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Is that so wrong for a silly little globe?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, you're right."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Well thanks for bringing the limitations of my quest to attention."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_secondencounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Bye for now."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_forgotten/0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh. It’s you."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_forgotten/0/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Got kinda used to you walkin' back and forth, not even lookin' my way. ...guess you forgot, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_forgotten/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "To be honest, I kind of did."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_forgotten/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, no, of course not! In fact, I've got a story for you."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_forgotten/0/c-1/7 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...really? Then g'wan then, let's hear it!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/1/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Anyways, that's great! Got it all written down!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/1/16
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Did you have any more?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, that's it!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That should be all of them!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/1/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not right now, but I want to keep looking for more!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The Scandalabra is from a small village in Switzerland!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Amir is from the middle east."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dorian is from England, gotta be."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I talked to Keyes!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Y'know how Jean Loo is a rapper?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hero Hime is from a crane game, I think."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So pretty sure Keith is from Spain."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I, Ronaldini is from Saskatchewan."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jacques Pierrot is a pirate from places unknown..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kopi is from Singapore!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Miranda is from Mexico!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dasha's from Russia."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you heard of our resident goddess, Rongomaiwhenua?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mateo Manta is from Mexico!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cabrizzio is very Italian."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drysdale must be from abroad with that accent!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kristof is... from somewhere there's vikings!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Daisuke is from Japan."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...actually, I don't think I have any others. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-4/11
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "G'wan sure."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-4/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, he traveled all the way here through many different hands!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-4/19/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Okay, if you say so."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-4/19/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Eh, sorry ducky, sounds like he was pullin' your leg. He just doesn't have that same... somethin' that the other travelers do."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-4/19/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So... you think he lied?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-4/19/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Yeah! Sorry!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/15 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/56 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/51
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ooh!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/29
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Salam, Gaia."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/37
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh, goodness, look at you!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/45
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I will regale you with a fact about my homeland of Iran."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/53
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Persian weddings are marvelous affairs."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/61
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "They have a beautiful ceremonial spread called <i>Sofreh Aghd</i>."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/69
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It's got spices, coins, desserts, and best of all, a large mirror as the centerpiece."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/77
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "The bride comes in veiled, and the groom gets his first look at her through the mirror."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/85
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Aww... That's so romantic~!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/96
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I think so too."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/104
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "The mirror symbolizes light and a bright future for the happy couple."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/112
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "There's also candelabras on either side of the mirror. Their fire symbolizes purity."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/120
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/128
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "The mirror set up sounds like somethin' else. But the candelabra part worries me a bit."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/136
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I hope Scandalabra's never been invited to one of those. (He's kinda sketchy.)"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-5/144
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Oh my goodness... I wouldn't invite him to be part of my spread."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "That's lovely!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/29
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "What's all this, then."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/37
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh! That's one of the things they say over there!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/45
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Rubbish."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/53
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ooooh - keep going."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/61
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Are you having a laugh?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/69
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I'm.... taking the piss?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/77
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Listen, you two."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/85
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Canada and America are beholden to ENGLAND for smithing and refining the language we're speaking right now."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/93
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Which is called?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "English?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "American?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Canadian?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "ENGLISH."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "From England, land of 'Angles'."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "YOU BLOODY WELL KNOW IT'S NOT."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "We're speaking Canadian, are we?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Did you take Canadian classes in primary school?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Did you watch anime with Canadian subtitles?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/c-2/34
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Don't think so."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/g-0/3
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Did we... learn anything? From that..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-6/101/g-0/11
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "(I do like getting under his doorframe just a little, though - always worth a giggle.)"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "That's far..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/26
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Darling! Allow me to tell you about my homeland: Nigeria!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/34
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "As is my duty as a performer, I have brought only the most incredible and spine-tingling facts, spoken to you in a most arresting manner."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/42
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Chappal Wahdi is the highest point in Nigeria, standing at 2,419 meters!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/50
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Uh huh, uh huh..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/58
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "Also, Nigeria is the only place in the world where you can find the Anambra waxbill bird, a member of the estrildid finch family."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/66
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "And before you think that you can find this fearless flyer all over Nigeria... think again."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/74 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/138 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/198
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/82
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "It is only found in Southern Nigeria."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/90 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Wow!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/98
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Is that all!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/106
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I have one more fact, extremely rare and terribly secret."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/114
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "There are 3,798 km of railways."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/122
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "293 km of them 1.435m standard gauge."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/130
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "3,505 km of them 1.067m narrow gauge."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/146
msgctxt "Keyes"
msgid "I trust you all enjoyed the performance."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-7/154
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Pretty sure everyone knows that. You can hear him all over the house."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/29
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Including here! Jean Loo is here now."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/37
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Wah!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/45
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Jeez b'y, you scared the mountains off me..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/53
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "Lil' Crapper, he has been informed that you wish to know about his homeland, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/61
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "This he will tell you... In the form of a rap!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/69
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/77
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "No, that's okay."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/85
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Jean Loo begins beatboxing."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/93
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ Hip-hop's is popular in the US. When it comes to <i>le rap</i> people say they're the best. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/101
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ But the French start to lash out with their silver tongues. / You think we're 2nd place? We are second to none! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/109
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ You come for my people? The battle is on. / Flushed out with a faceful of varied <i>verlan</i>. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/117
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Jean Loo leans over and does a call and response with himself."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/125
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "<i>\"Verlan?\" \"Verlan?\" Qu'est-ce que le \"verlan\"?!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/133
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ <i>Verlan</i> is the well where new language is drawn! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/141
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "♪ If the syllables permit, you turn and reverse it / The meaning's the same but you change how it's worded! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/149
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "So, uh... You take the syllables of a word. But then you swap them. So, example:"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/157
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "<i>Musique</i>. <i>Musique</i> becomes <i>\"zicmu\".<i> It means the same as before. But now it is backwards. Now it is <i>spicy.<i>"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/165
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh. Okay. I get it, I think!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/173
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "That's cool. Or, I guess.. \"ool-coo?\" Nah, that's pig latin! Doesn't really work in English, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-8/181
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "<i>Non!</i> This is one of the reasons French is the best language! And so Jean Loo uses it now to bid you </i>adieu!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Wow! I thought she was Japanese! I never heard of \"Akraingam\". Where's that?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/29
msgctxt "Hero-Hime"
msgid "A \"crane game\"! It's a type of arcade game."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/37
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ohhh. Wow, I'm some stunned."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/45
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "See, when I said needed help understanding more of the outside world? This is what I was talkin' about."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/53
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "OOkay! Crane game. G'wan. Tell me about it."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/61
msgctxt "Hero-Hime"
msgid "Players manipulate a crane through a pile of prizes. If they have the skills, they get to keep any they take home!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/72 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/112
msgctxt "Nekoboru"
msgid "Nekoboru."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/80
msgctxt "Hero-Hime"
msgid "That's right, Nekoboru. If you want to get good - the only way is hard work and lots and lots of coins."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/88
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "What can you win?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/96
msgctxt "Hero-Hime"
msgid "Prizes can be anything from figures, to candy, to posters... even vegetables."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/104
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I don't think I'd want to eat a vegetable that's been sitting in a stack of prizes for who-knows-how long."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/120
msgctxt "Hero-Hime"
msgid "Haha! That's right Nekoboru."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/128
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Haha! Yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-9/142
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "(...you didn't get that either, right? It's not just me?)"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Makes sense to me with a devilishly charming accent like that..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/29
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Alas, no!!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/37
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Gibraltar is a small place next to Spain. There are only around 32,000 people who live there."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/45
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oops. That's embarrassing."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/53
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "One would think of all of us here, shouldn't you know its location?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/61
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Not everything is labelled, okay!!!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/69
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "And there's some countries stuck to me backside!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/80
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "Hah!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/88
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "You can remember I hail from Gibraltar because we have a key on our flag!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/96
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh, that <i>is</i> easy to remember!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/104
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I won't forget it! I've got it... <i>on lock</i>."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-10/112
msgctxt "Keith"
msgid "I... must be on my way."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "What?! Really?! I didn't know he was Canadian! He's a magician so I figure he must be from somewhere exotic."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/29
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "But I am from the most exotic of Canadian locales!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/37
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh! Nunavut?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/45
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "Lloydminster, Saskatchewan."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/53
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Bless you!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/61
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Figures you'd be from Saskatchewan, though. Place is as flat as an ironing board."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/69
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "How dare you assume that just because of my own form!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/77
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sorry! All I know is that part of me is flat! Look! Rectangle!!!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/85
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "My dear Gaia, since I have been let out of my small door, I have done some research on my homestead!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/93
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I await the prestige..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/101
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "There exist many a dune of sand in Saskatchewan!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/112
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sand dunes?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/120
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "Northernmost sand dunes in the world!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/128
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I would imagine it would be difficult to clean clothes full of sand, wouldn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/136
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "Hence leaving the world of laundry and entering the realm of magical arts!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/144
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Wow. Never would've guessed."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/152
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "The more you know..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-11/168
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "I, Ronaldini away!!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh, I've always wondered where Jacques was from!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/29
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "Wondering about me without my permission, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/37
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "O-Oh, I'm sorry!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/45/b/1
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "Haven't we quested together somewhere before? Dark... bugs... a goddess?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/45/b/9
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "You should definitely know where I'm from at any rate."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/48
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "I am from the sea. My mother was a gale and my father a column of thunder!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/64
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "But where were you assembled?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/80
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "Pegwell Bay. Just east of Ramsgate."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/88
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Issat where you got your peg leg?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/96
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "Well, I got this peg leg from a fierce battle with the seven headed hydra known as Penelopae!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/104
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sounds frightening!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... I wonder..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She's actually just the harmless office supplies."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/c-1/7
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "Imagine! Being made of so many different types of object! Pens with their stabbing and staining - paper clips morphing into phantasmagorical shapes..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/c-1/15
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "...and what sailor has ever survived an encounter with glue of such super-strength as to stick their fingers together!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/c-1/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "\"There... be... dragons... \" Got it!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/g-0/0
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "And I know more about that ocean than your painted swells can ever tell!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/g-0/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh yeah? Try to out ocean-fact me!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/g-0/16
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "When a sailor scrubs the deck of a ship at sea, the goal is to scrub the saltwater deeper into the wood because it prevents wood eating bacteria from growing."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/g-0/24
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "I do all the scrubbing meself as me own crew seems to be on permanent bloody holiday."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/g-0/32
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...okay, fair enough. Didn't know that."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/g-0/40
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Most of my ocean facts are about how cold and murdery it is."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/g-0/51
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "And also how water in our bay's totally toxic for a long time because we dumped like 500 years of sewage into it. Whoops."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-12/112/g-0/59
msgctxt "Jacques"
msgid "Aye, sewage - the true scourge of the seas."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Her name is based on the word for coffee in Malaysian and Indonesian."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/13
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "That's right! Coffee, or 'kopi', has a rich culture in Southeast Asia!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/21
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "No matter where you are... Singapore, Malaysia, Indonesia, Thailand, Brunei... the Kopitiam is super culturally significant!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/32
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Huh? The what??"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/43
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh, Kopitiam! That's the name for coffee shops! It comes from 'kopi' from Malay and Indonesian, and 'tiam' from the word for \"shop\" in Hokkien!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/59
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's where people come together to really just... socialise! Whether that's to appreciate the caffeine, or to see old friends..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/67
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Kopi isn't just about being a drink; it's about bringing together community!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/75
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Gosh, it sounds like I'm talking in the third person, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/83
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But it's true, Southeast Asia is really a hotpot of cultures from all walks of life!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/91 gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/53
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Mmhm."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/99
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Heck, people probably don't really expect me to be Singaporean."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/107
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I dunno, I think it's because I was originally assembled in Australia? Some brand called Breadville?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-13/23/c-0/115
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Still, what a wild factoid! Let me just write that right over Singapore on my map..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/21
msgctxt "Miranda"
msgid "That I am!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/29
msgctxt "Miranda"
msgid "As the resident singer here, I want to regale you with a musical fact!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/37
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I like music. I like facts."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/45
msgctxt "Miranda"
msgid "Mexico has a rich history with mariachi music."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/61
msgctxt "Miranda"
msgid "The first female band to ever perform mariachi was \"Las Adelitas\"."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/69
msgctxt "Miranda"
msgid "They were named after a famous ballad, <i>La Adelita</i>, which is about a woman fighting in the Mexican Revolution."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/77
msgctxt "Miranda"
msgid "<i>Adelita</i> is the nickname given to the women who fought alongside men in the Mexican Revolutionary War."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/85
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ooh, <i>vive la révolution</i>!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/96
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...wait. That's French. I'm an idiot."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/107
msgctxt "Miranda"
msgid "Actually the Spanish is pretty much the same. <i>Viva la revolución.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-14/115
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Haha! I lied! I'm a genius! A language-knowing genius!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Did someone say the words <i>'Dasha'</i> and <i>'Russia'?!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/29
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "They did, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Da. Well... perhaps you are hoping for Dasha to show you Russian culture of weight-lifting?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/45
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Just give us some fun facts."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/53
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/61
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/69
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Tell me, little globe, are you familiar with Russian Fox Experiment?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/77
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "What? No. Tell me. Were they turning people into foxes?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/85
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/93
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Boo."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/101
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/109
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "A Russian geneticist started experiment to see if one could domesticate foxes."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/117
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She pauses for effect."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/125
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Well... could they?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/133
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "To put it simply, yes. But it was complicated experiment."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/141
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Scientists wanted to better understand domestication process."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/149
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "They found domesticated foxes showed certain traits in common with dogs."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/157
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "For example: ears of flop, spots of many colors..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/165
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "One fox even had star patch on forehead! Imagine!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/173
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "A fox looking like anime heroine..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/181
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You said it was complicated... but that sounds pretty simple!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/189
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is VERY complicated. I am simply good explainer."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/197
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "So what else did they learn about domestication then?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/205
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Many things!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/213
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Such as?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/221
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You know... there was the... domestication..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/237
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...is complicated."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/245
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "An awkward silence falls. Dasha purses her lips, then does a big, exaggerated yawn."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/253
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Well, it's long journey to here from desk. Oh, so tired. Dasha must be going now."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/264
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ooh, okay! That's weird!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/272
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "So I guess floppy ears and stuff are just the universal pet traits, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/280
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "That's... not a fact I expected about Russia of all places!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/288
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Mission accomplished."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-15/296
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "(Note to self: Look into buying a fox...)"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Of course! I met her in that sooty place you call a 'crawl space'."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/29
msgctxt "Rongomaiwhenua"
msgid "Hello, my child."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/61
msgctxt "Rongomaiwhenua"
msgid "You appear to wish for me to give you some sort of 'fact'."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/69
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You got me."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/77
msgctxt "Rongomaiwhenua"
msgid "Many of my formations are beautiful in ways that only I can sense."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/85
msgctxt "Rongomaiwhenua"
msgid "There is beauty in some delicately arranged constructs hundreds of meters below my surface that you may never witness."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/93
msgctxt "Rongomaiwhenua"
msgid "For your sake, I do find a certain formation called \"Queen's Head\" in what has been designated as Yehliu, Taiwan."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/104
msgctxt "Rongomaiwhenua"
msgid "Here the formation has naturally crafted a bust of one of your famous human queens, Nefertiti."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/112
msgctxt "Rongomaiwhenua"
msgid "Purely accidental, but worth noting nonetheless."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/120
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ooh, very cool. I've heard some cool rock facts in my day, and I'd say that one head and shoulders above the rest!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/128
msgctxt "Rongomaiwhenua"
msgid "Remain well, small representation of my form."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-16/145
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I wonder if Rongomaiwhenua would be interested in my island? We do call it \"The Rock\" sometimes! Seems like it'd be in her wheelhouse."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You don't say?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/29
msgctxt "Mateo"
msgid "Did I just hear someone about to talk about textiles?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/37
msgctxt "Mateo"
msgid "I am from Mexico - which has a long history of textile work... stretching back 3500 years."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/45
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Stretching back like <i>fabric</i>!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/61
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I am so funny."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/69
msgctxt "Mateo"
msgid "Don't worry, I love talking about fabric!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/77
msgctxt "Mateo"
msgid "Humid areas use cotton for clothing. Drier climates like Mexico use fiber from plants like yucca."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/85
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Yucca... Why does that sound familiar...?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/93
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh! OH!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/101
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Does that grow in the Yucatán Peninsula? Is that why it's called the YUCA-tán?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/109
msgctxt "Mateo"
msgid "Hate to disappoint but... long ago some conquistadors asked the locals what their land was called and they said something that sounded like \"Yucatán\"."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/117
msgctxt "Mateo"
msgid "Which meant, \"I can't understand what you're saying.\""
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/125
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "<i>SNORT</i> Kinda sounds like an ol' wives' tale."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/133
msgctxt "Mateo"
msgid "<i>SNORT</i>"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-17/141
msgctxt "Mateo"
msgid "Yeah, probably... still pretty funny though!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-18/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "And rather fetching, no?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-18/29
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "I am Cabrizzio. And I am from Italia."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-18/37
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "D'ya have any facts?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-18/45
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "These are all the facts I can give."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-18/53
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Aside from the fact that I am from Italia."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-18/61
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Well, at least we got to hear your beautiful voice!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-18/69
msgctxt "Cabrizzio"
msgid "Thank you for visiting, Cabrizzio..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-18/88
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Isn't that my line??"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-19/11
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ah no..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-19/19
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Some travelers just have accents!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-19/27
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "He and Washford were cut from the same cloth..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-19/35
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...er, metal tube."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-19/43
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "He just plays it up for the fans."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/21
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Noreg!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/29
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sorry?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/37
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "...Norway."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/45
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh I see - Noreg is the word that your brethren use to name your country!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/53
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You look - fierce, Kristof. Where are you from?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/61
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Hell."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/69
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh! I didn't know that was a real place! How do you deal with all the fire and brimstone?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/77
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Brimstone? Are you speaking of <i>hel</i>?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/85
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "No, Hell!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/93
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Hel!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/101
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Yes, Hell?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think he's spelling it differently, Gaia."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Hell is the town where I was made."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Hel is the place you will go when I am done with many many violences upon you."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/c-0/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Upon me!?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/c-0/34
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "How else do you think I will conquer the world if not on a globe first?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/c-0/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, Kristof, Gaia is a sweetheart. There will be no conquering of her today."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/c-0/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kristof"
msgid "Fine. Maybe not this globe... But watch out - other representations of the world!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/c-0/42/c-0/18
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...should I be afraid?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/c-0/42/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, he's all the way in the gym."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-20/109/c-0/42/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Phew!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh wow, Japan?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/29/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Hero-hime is from there too!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/29/b/9
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Hero-hime is from a fictional version of Japan."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/29/b/20
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "A crane game, if I am not mistaken."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/29/b/28
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I am from the real version of Japan."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/32
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Osaka, to be precise."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/40
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh yes, we love precision."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/48
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "What <i>precisely</i> is it that makes Osaka special?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/56
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "It is impossible to sum up Osaka in only a few words."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/64
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Could you try? This game's already over a million words as it is."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/72
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "This game?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/80
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You know... this little game we're playin'. Spot the travelers?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/88
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Ah. Yes. Well..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/96
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Osaka is known for its historical sites and tourist attractions."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/104
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Osaka Castle, for example, and Dotonbori."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/112
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Do-ton-whatty?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/120
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Dotonbori is an area famous for its neon lights, nightlife, and the canal which shares its name."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/128
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I have heard it is featured heavily in a popular video game series about the yakuza, but that is none of my business."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/136
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Yakuza? You mean the Japanese mafia?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/144
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "None. Of. My. Business."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/152
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/163
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "In Japan Osaka is loved for more than just heritage sites and nightlife."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/171
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "People from Osaka have a reputation for being more friendly and nosy than those from Tokyo."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/179
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "We have become known for the manzai style of comedy, a two-person comedy act."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/187
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "It is so closely-associated with Osaka that many manzai comedians speak with a Kansai-accent when they perform."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/195
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh wow! Guess some accents just make things sound better."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/203
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I cannot speak to that."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/211
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "The bottom line is that we are simply funnier than everyone else."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/219
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh yeah... I'm just barely holdin' myself together talkin' to ya."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/227
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/238
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Wonder if we could get him to put on a comedy show for us one of these nights..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-21/246
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "No, no, better not. Don't know if I could handle laughing quite so much."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-22/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Aw, dang. Well, thanks for checking in."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-22/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Did you need any hints on where to find more travelers?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-22/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly, just ready to be all done with finding them!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-22/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm good."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-22/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That could help, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-22/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Okay. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_storytime/0/gaia_storytime_start/c-22/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I got a general sense of where they are! Let's spin me around and see who I can find!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/0/b/9
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "... Y'know to be honest, it really hurt seein' you walk by and not so much as acknowledge me for , like, a whole week... But I s'pose what I asked you to do takes time."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/0/b/17
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Thanks for takin' time outta your day to come back and talk to me. It means a lot."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Cool, thanks again!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/4
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Say, um... Not to be greedy, but... I’d really love to hear some more stories, if you wouldn’t mind?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/12
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Not too many, just a couple, and only if ya got the time."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/20
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "(Though, truth be told, I'd love as many as you could get...)"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Please?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, but I don't think I have time."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just being real, you're bugged out and I'm trying to Realize other characters."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_request/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Aw, you're the best! Thanks, muh lover!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/60/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "W-Whoa! That's... that's all of 'em! You talked to all of them! I don't even know HOW I know... but I do!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/60/b/12
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "T-Thank you... It really means the world to me."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/60/b/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Here, take me favorite book. Around the World in 80 Days."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/60/b/34
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You did it yourself in less than half the time Phineas did."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/63/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh, what's this now? Aw... love, you didn't have to go and do all that for me."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/63/b/9
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Thank you. It really means the world to me."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/66/b/1
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "This was really sweet of you. It really means the world to me."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/69
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "My brain is actually working! I feel filled out! Completed! Fully <i>charted!</i> WA-HOO!!!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so happy for you!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Go, Gaia, go!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Wow... That's so strange."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I finally have a full list of places that I know I could visit... But the only place I want to be is next to you."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The realization of what she's just said brings a sweet flush to Gaia's freckled cheeks."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "A-Ah! Gosh, that's embarrassing! Probably shouldn't just say stuff out loud like that!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love that, Gaia."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... I thought we'd be better as friends?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Thinkin' about you just makes my head spin, to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "If it's not too much trouble, would you mind bringin' me along on your next outing?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I don't care where we go! As long as I'm with you, I'll be peachy keen! Heehee!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-3/7 gaia_globe/gaia_friend/0/60
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Aw, that's alright then, you g'wan!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Friends it is!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-3/23 gaia_globe/gaia_friend/0/76
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "My mental scrapbook is so much grander now, thanks to you! Let's take a photo."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-3/31 gaia_globe/gaia_friend/0/84
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Gaia whips out a mobile phone, snaps a photo, and tucks it back in her jacket before you can even react."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-3/45 gaia_globe/gaia_friend/0/95
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "<w>Cla-click!</w> There! It’s added."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-3/53 gaia_globe/gaia_friend/0/103
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You think I'd be rotted bein' stuck here, but it's not too bad with your kind floatin' about, I must say."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love/0/g-0/c-3/64/0/s/0 gaia_globe/gaia_friend/0/111/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks! ...I think?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_friend/0/68
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I s'pose this is enough anyways. Much better than an empty map! I can use the info you gave me as a starting point and explore from there! It's like a hint on a treasure hunt."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hate/60
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Seriously?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hate/68
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You've got some nerve, y'know that?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hate/76
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I'm right tilted now! 23.5 degrees, in fact!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hate/84
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Tell you what. I've got an idea: How about you pick one o' the countries on my sleeves... Then go there, and don't come back!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hate/95 gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Hmph!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hate/137
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "The breakup heard 'round the world."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Welcome back, my angel! My trout!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww. I'm your angel!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Make a fish face.</i> Blub blub."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Gaia."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "And together we can fly anywhere we want! Here, pick a place!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Gaia begins spinning."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...poke!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Haha! That tickles!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Love yer blubs. Ever think about visiting the ocean? Which coast is your favorite?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Atlantic"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pacific"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm more of a freshwater person."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ah, nothin' like home. I could show you around the Rock! Or we could go further south, if you want. Or across the pond!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Aaaah, I'm so excited!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Ooh, we could trot through one of those redwood forests! All the way up and down the ring of fire!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/c-1/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "It'd be nice to go somewhere warm for a change. Had enough of that RDF."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...RDF?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Rain, drizzle, and fog!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Alright, there's no changin' my mind now! We'll go somewhere tropical. You and me!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_lovereturn/0/c-1/18/c-2/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "That's why you're me trout!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh hey! How you makin' out?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "E-Excuse me?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haven't made out with anyone yet."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got good news - I'm ready to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh. Uh... Is everything going well with you, friend?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I'm alright."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "She comes and she goes?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She does!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "That's all we can ask for, I s'pose."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep. Well... see you around!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Gaia spins in a circle."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "She comes and she goes~!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "That's not what I meant."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_friendshipreturn/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh! Haha. Awkward. ...bye!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Wha?! Go 'way, sure!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Seriously!? I can run around and travel on planes and boats and what-have-you?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_join/0/16
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I get to have LEGS?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_join/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, legs!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_join/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Or... I'd like to Realize you... but I don't have the stats yet."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Aww... Okay. I'll wait right here. You got this gal excited so don't let me down!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You're back! Are you ready to Realize!?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes now."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah... sorry to keep doing this, but no."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Well quit pullin' my leg then! Aaaah, I can't take the waiting!!!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Gaia spins in a circle, faster than usual..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_begin/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Aaaah, I'm so excited! I feel like I could fly!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_begin/11
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Actually, that'd be wicked. Can my human body have wings? Can I be a wing-a-ling human? Can you do that?!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_begin/25
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I'm afraid not. But I'll do my best to keep that feeling intact!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_begin/33/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Boy, I hope this works for our first one... Gaia deserves to see her world!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_begin/36
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Spin for us, Gaia!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realize_begin/47
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a globe, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Whoa."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "WHOA!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Check me out! I'm just a little guy! A little guy who fits comfortably on economy airliner seats!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Where should I fly to first? Where should I visit?! Aaaah, I can't decide!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Gaia spins around but quickly becomes dizzy. She teeters back and forth with swirls in her eyes."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/46
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "WaaaAaaAaah... If I do that again I'm gonna lose me lunch."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/54
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Gasp! I'll have lunch to lose! There's so many human things I gets to do!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like maybe... a little kiss?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like travel?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/c-0/10
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I would absolutely—"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "<w>Urp</w> Blugh..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe later when you're not in danger of puking."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Peck her on the cheek.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "That! Is fair!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/c-0/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Teehee!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_realized/0/c-0/26/c-1/18
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You're some sweet."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Okay. First thing's first! Gotta gets meself a ticket. Gotta gets meself a passport!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "There's no time to lose! I'm gonna get on the first bus I can find and just go. Where I end up... nobody knows!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, good luck."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please write down my number in case you need it."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Gaia salutes you. She scampers upstairs and frantically begins packing."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her first few months as a human are fraught with problems. Airport security doesn't take \"I used to be a piece of furniture\" as an excuse. She ends up detained more than once."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "However, within the year Gaia begins her globetrotting journey."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She always travels light, but never forgets to bring her scrapbook which contains hundreds of pages of photos, postcards, restaurant menus, tickets, and anything else she can catalogue."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Whenever you plan a trip, Gaia is the first one you call. She always knows the best spots."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And whenever you disembark at the airport, she's always waiting for you at the baggage claim."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_love_join/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Even if you didn't tell her you'd be traveling."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/8
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I'm givin' you the silent treatment! What goes around comes around."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...like a globe?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... just because we might have a difference of opinion doesn't mean that we can't be friends. (USE SMARTS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Like a globe!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I s'pose you're right about that."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I gave you a quest, but maybe I was wrong for doin' that in the first place."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...and I do appreciate you taking the time."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You might not've found me the traveler stories I was looking for, but... At least I know we both have an eye for faraway places."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friends?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/globe_hatereturn/0/c-1/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...friends."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_mirror/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Well... Sometimes before going on a journey it can be a good idea to <b>reflect</b> on things first! Look inside so you know where you want to be on the outside."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_mirror/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Any idea where you might be able to reflect?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_piano/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Y'know, the things I've heard 'round here do tend to be little secrets!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_piano/36
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "So for the privacy of others, I'll be sure to say my next one <i>pianissimo</i>."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_piano/47
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "But not this time. Nope."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_toilet/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I hear the toilet has a funny way 'a talkin'."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_toilet/36
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Literally. I literally <i>hear</i> him. He's so loud."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_toilet/47
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "A strange way of talkin' might mean he's from outta town, if ya know what I mean. You could check there?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_anime/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Hmm... Well, most TV comes from the US. But I know you watch anime sometimes! That's from overseas!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_anime/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Don't suppose you've got any merchandise, do ya?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_key/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Once heard a rumor about a smooth-talker who could open any kind of door. I bet that guy’s been lots of places!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_key/36
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Maybe even seen the whole world over, <b>lock</b>, stock, and barrel!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_iron/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Y'know, there used to be this magic show. The magician was supposed to be super mysterious. I wonder what ever happened to that guy?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_iron/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Magicians always have names like \"El Magnifico\" or \"I'll Pull-a-Rabbit-Out-Of-a-Hat-io! Those sound foreign! Maybe he was a traveler too!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_ship/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Oh! How could I forget! Cap’n Jacques Pierrot! He's got a ship, he must’ve gone plenty of places!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_ship/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "He's just across the way by the chesterfield there."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_ship/47
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Er... the couch. Sorry. More 'a my islander speak comin' out, haha."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_coffee/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Gosh... There are so many options. Before I send you runnin' all over the place, maybe you should grab a cup of coffee!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_coffee/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "That'll keep your brain active while you're exploring!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_toaster/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "As me mudder used to say, \"If you wanna broaden your horizons, follow your stomach! If you don't stay well fed, pretty soon you'll be TOAST!\""
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_toaster/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "She said it exactly like that. My mom was a weird, weird lady."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_blanket/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You'd think anybody with an accent would be a traveler, but that's not true! Sometimes they're second or third generation and just picked it up from their parents."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_blanket/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "You don't want to make any kind of <b>blanket statement</b> about anyone. I learned that the hard way."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_desk/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Hmmm... someone with world experience... Hard to think of someone who fits that desk-cription."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_desk/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Er. <i>Description</i>. Sorry. Bit me tongue."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_geodes/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I know this seems tricky! There are so many folks to talk to. But some of them can only be found through a magnificent quest..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_geodes/39
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Try speakin' with Beau! She's great with quests."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_cabinet/0/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "The cabinets... the cabinets!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_cabinet/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_cabinet/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "It's a vision... clear as day."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_cabinet/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Cabinets."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_cabinet/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Do y'know what that might mean?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_cabinet/0/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I should go speak with the cabinets?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_cabinet/0/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...maybe.... maybe..."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_crosstrainer/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sometimes I feel like I go 'round in circles."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_crosstrainer/36
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "But you humans have these machines that let you walk forever and go nowhere!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_dishes/28
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Sometimes I get dizzy with all these tectonic plates movin' 'round inside me."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint_dishes/36
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "But as I don't spose there's anything tectonic nearby, you'll have to do with regular ones!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint2/0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Hope that helps. Sorry, I'm still a little scatterbrained!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Any other leads?"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint2/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_hint2/0/c-1/7 gaia_globe/gaia_seen_everyone/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "Good luck! Don't get lost!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_seen_everyone/0/0
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "...whoa! That's crazy!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_seen_everyone/0/11
msgctxt "Gaia"
msgid "I don't have any hints left!"
msgstr ""

#: gaia_globe/gaia_seen_everyone/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay - the hunt is on!"
msgstr ""
